{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SquareMan-Boy</strong> is a fast paced action platformer with focus on quick and precise movement. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're always in motion, bounced between color-coded blocks, dodging lasers, and racing to the exit. Use your charge dash, world rotators, and teleporters to bend each level to your will. Every second counts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Each level has an exit and your goal is to reach it without dying</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/goal3.gif?t=1749929478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Press and hold to charge a dash, release the button to charge away with great speed</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/charge2.gif?t=1749929478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>World rotators will always rotate the level 90 degrees clockwise</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/rotate.gif?t=1749929478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Teleporters will let you travel unharmed to its same colored twin</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/teleportGif.gif?t=1749929478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leaderboards for quickest times on each level</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Global or between steam friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast paced action with responsive controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 100+ handcrafted levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Large amount of bite-sized levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Neon style graphics and effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Synthwave sounds track</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full controller support </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/SquareMan-Boy_Logo.png?t=1749929478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/MultiGif5-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1749929478\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/youtube_preview.png?t=1749929478\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1639710?t=1749929478","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749929478","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749929478","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749929478","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content